00:07:43,080 --> 00:07:49,000
So how do frequentists try to measure the probability of the world ending?

161
00:07:49,500 --> 00:07:50,840
Well, they look for repeated trials.

162
00:07:51,080 --> 00:07:55,400
They ask, how many times have we run the experiment of a technological civilization?

