00:08:03,520 --> 00:08:05,820
The experiment has only been run once and it hasn't ended.

168
00:08:06,200 --> 00:08:06,460
Right.

169
00:08:06,460 --> 00:08:12,960
But frequentist statistics actually has a specific mathematical tool for dealing with zero observed

