00:09:02,120 --> 00:09:04,860
It tells us absolutely nothing about the actual risk.

195
00:09:05,420 --> 00:09:10,740
But the paper points out an even deeper flaw in the frequentist approach when dealing with

196
00:09:10,740 --> 00:09:11,740
