00:09:11,740 --> 00:09:15,820
Something called the observer selection effect or the anthropic shadow.

198
00:09:15,820 --> 00:09:16,060
Yeah.

199
00:09:16,200 --> 00:09:19,240
This is a critical philosophical and mathematical hurdle.

200
00:09:19,440 --> 00:09:24,160
Any data we collect about the survival of the human race must be conditioned on the fact that we are

