00:09:24,160 --> 00:09:25,500
currently alive to collect it.

202
00:09:25,500 --> 00:09:29,760
We cannot observe a historical record in which we did not survive.

203
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:32,020
Let's create a mental model for the listener here.

204
00:09:32,560 --> 00:09:36,920
Imagine you were placed in front of a firing squad of 100 expert marksmen.

205
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:38,740
They all point their rifles at you.

206
00:09:38,840 --> 00:09:39,720
They pull the triggers.

207
00:09:40,100 --> 00:09:41,420
You hear a deafening roar.

208
00:09:41,800 --> 00:09:44,160
But you are completely unharmed.

209
00:09:44,500 --> 00:09:49,300
You're standing there trying to calculate the probability that they all missed by pure chance versus

210
00:09:49,300 --> 00:09:52,080
