211
00:09:52,520 --> 00:09:55,280
The natural instinct is to look at the evidence.

212
00:09:55,600 --> 00:09:57,680
And the evidence is that you survived.

213
00:09:58,160 --> 00:10:03,300
But the anthropic shadow tells us that the evidence of your survival is actually mathematically useless for

214
00:10:03,300 --> 00:10:04,700
