218
00:10:10,060 --> 00:10:14,400
You can only ever observe the scenario where you survive, regardless of whether the true

219
00:10:14,400 --> 00:10:19,660
probability of surviving was 99% or 0.000 under 1%.

220
00:10:19,660 --> 00:10:20,140
Yeah.

221
00:10:20,240 --> 00:10:22,160
So the likelihood function is totally flat.

222
00:10:22,160 --> 00:10:29,920
If the true per-era probability of global catastrophe throughout history was, say, 1%, the historical

223
00:10:29,920 --> 00:10:34,180
record observed by the survivors would contain exactly zero terminal events.

224
00:10:34,180 --> 00:10:42,600
And if the true per-era probability was 90%, the historical record observed by the survivors would still contain

225
00:10:42,600 --> 00:10:44,760
exactly zero terminal events.

226
00:10:45,340 --> 00:10:50,340
The parameter of risk is mathematically unidentifiable from the historical record alone.

227
00:10:50,520 --> 00:10:52,520
So the frequentists are completely stuck.

