237
00:11:13,800 --> 00:11:15,400
It sounds a lot much more flexible.

238
00:11:15,500 --> 00:11:17,300
It is, under normal circumstances.

239
00:11:18,020 --> 00:11:21,340
But existential risk creates a state of evidential dependence.

240
00:11:21,520 --> 00:11:21,740
Okay.

