00:11:27,660 --> 00:11:33,160
doesn't actually contain any new independent information about the underlying risk parameter.

244
00:11:33,160 --> 00:11:38,140
Because surviving is the only way we could possibly be having the conversation in the first place.

245
00:11:38,620 --> 00:11:41,860
Therefore, the mathematical updating process just breaks down.

246
00:11:42,520 --> 00:11:45,820
The Bayesian formula requires new evidence to shift the prior.

247
00:11:46,060 --> 00:11:46,340
Right.

248
00:11:46,660 --> 00:11:50,860
Since the evidence of survival is effectively a mathematical constant for any observer,

249
00:11:50,860 --> 00:11:56,760
the posterior estimate simply collapses back into whatever the analyst chose for their prior.

250
00:11:57,120 --> 00:11:57,740
Oh, wow.

251
00:11:57,900 --> 00:12:00,160
So we're right back where we started with the reference window.

252
00:12:00,360 --> 00:12:00,860
Exactly.

253
00:12:01,120 --> 00:12:06,980
The math is just a very expensive, very complicated mirror reflecting the analyst's subjective assumptions

254
00:12:06,980 --> 00:12:10,740
back at them, completely untouched by actual reality.

255
00:12:11,080 --> 00:12:13,400
The illusion of objective capture is total.

256
