00:25:28,380 --> 00:25:31,140
could defeat the iterative unmasking technique entirely.

524
00:25:31,140 --> 00:25:32,220
They flatten the curve.

525
00:25:32,500 --> 00:25:33,800
They flatten the curve entirely.

526
00:25:34,500 --> 00:25:39,940
They manipulate the secondary and tertiary features so precisely that the document becomes

527
00:25:39,940 --> 00:25:44,600
mathematically indistinguishable from the target author, no matter how many layers the

528
00:25:44,600 --> 00:25:45,540
AI peels back.

529
00:25:45,600 --> 00:25:47,440
The implications here are just profound.

